OL,3,GNEWSACollapse fears over long-running
OL,4,Asubsidence issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents at a housing block in west
OL,7,FLondon say they are "terrified the
OL,8,Fbuilding is going to collapse" after
OL,9,Fyears of cracks appearing in their
OL,10,Fhomes, bricks coming loose and even a
OL,11,Fdoor falling out of its frame.
OL,13,FHomeowners and tenants at 31-49 Hanger
OL,14,FView Way in West Acton, Ealing, say
OL,15,Fthey first raised concerns about
OL,16,Fpotential subsidence in 2002 and say
OL,17,Fthe condition of the properties has
OL,18,Fcontinued to deteriorate.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
