OL,3,GNEWSACollapse fears over long-running
OL,4,Asubsidence issues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe housing association, Peabody, says
OL,7,Fthe properties are safe to live in,
OL,8,Fadding that a nearby tree is causing
OL,9,Fthe problems.
OL,11,FA spokesperson said: "We know this has
OL,12,Fbeen a long and frustrating wait, and
OL,13,Fwe want to get the tree removed so we
OL,14,Fcan get on with the permanent repairs."
